** =====================================================================
**  せん断で歪んだ差分加熱キャビティ（非構造メッシュ経路: InpMeshProcess + NavierStokesFVMProcess）
**  cavity-nc-1 と同じ物性・Ra ~ 1e3 を、平行四辺形（せん断 0.25）の 12×12×1 メッシュで解く。
**  予約面名 XM/XP（傾いた左右の壁）に温度固定、YM/YP は断熱壁、ZM/ZP は対称面。
**  実行: ykep -j=examples/inp/cavity-nc-2.inp int
** =====================================================================
*HEADING
 Differentially heated parallelogram cavity, Ra ~ 1e3 (unstructured FVM path)
*PARAMETER
 L      = 0.1
 T_hot  = 310.0
 T_cold = 290.0
 T_ref  = 0.5 * (T_hot + T_cold)
 rho    = 1.0
 mu     = 0.01
 Cp     = 1000.0
 k      = 1.0
 g      = 9.81
 Ra     = 1000.0
 nu     = mu / rho
 alpha  = k / (rho * Cp)
 beta   = Ra * nu * alpha / (g * (T_hot - T_cold) * L**3)
 max_outer = 3000
*INCLUDE, INPUT=cavity-skew-mesh.inp
*MATERIAL, NAME=AIR
*DENSITY
 <rho>
*VISCOSITY
 <mu>
*SPECIFIC HEAT
 <Cp>
*CONDUCTIVITY
 <k>
*EXPANSION, ZERO=<T_ref>
 <beta>
*FLUID SECTION, ELSET=ALL, MATERIAL=AIR
*INITIAL CONDITIONS, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 NALL, <T_ref>
*BOUNDARY, TYPE=SYMMETRY
 ZM
 ZP
*BOUNDARY, TYPE=TEMPERATURE
 XM, <T_hot>
 XP, <T_cold>
*STEP, NAME=Steady
*NAVIER STOKES, TURBULENCE=LAMINAR, STEADY STATE, HEAT TRANSFER=COUPLED
*DLOAD
 ALL, GRAV, <g>, 0.0, -1.0, 0.0
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=DISCRETIZATION
 CONVECTION=UPWIND, PRESSURE_VELOCITY=SIMPLE
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=RELAXATION
 VELOCITY=0.5, PRESSURE=0.2, TEMPERATURE=0.7
*CONTROLS, PARAMETERS=SOLVER
 PRESSURE=DIRECT, MOMENTUM=DIRECT, MAX_OUTER=<max_outer>, TOL=1e-4
*OUTPUT, FIELD, FORMAT=VTK+HTML
*ELEMENT OUTPUT
 U, P, T, RES
*END STEP
